    94	### Smoke, chunks, reruns
    95	- SMOKE first: the first 3 ids (eval/plans/007-smoke-ids.txt: 2 rich + 1 fastapi), budget 5400 s (rev 1: was 4800; fits the larger stop-guard reserve). The gate checks mechanics
